{
  "_comment": "Q-026 blessed-library — NonEmptyText FAIL case. Identical structure to 59, but supplies the empty string \"\" as the value. The verifier accepts the graph (the value is a String, structurally compatible with the schema's value type); the SchemaChecker invariant pass evaluates `non_empty` against the static value and reports SchemaInvariantViolation. Mirrors 51 (PositiveInt fail) and 53 (NonEmptyList fail) — designed-to-fail programs that prove the invariant-check stage runs and rejects bad values.",
